No ongoing JupyterLab compute charge

Your Serverless endpoint can remain In Service separately. With only 10 predictions/day, its inference compute cost is extremely small compared with leaving JupyterLab running.

So if you use JupyterLab, for example, 2 hours/day, your overall ongoing cost is roughly:

JupyterLab ₹9.57/day + Serverless ~₹0.002/day + S3 tiny storage cost ≈ ₹9.58/day.

The exact AWS bill can vary by region, instance pricing, Free Tier eligibility, storage, requests, and other services.

